  m_text: "When you open your eyes, you\u2019re in a dimly lit hall, torchlight flickering
    on ancient stone walls.\n\nA voice booms from nowhere,\n\u201COh, by the way\u2026
    seeming you didnt bother to read the next page, to get the power, you actually
    have to make it through this hall ... Alive... Good luck, you are going to need
    it!\u201D"
